# Pairs with UniqueOwner. Reproduces the undo half of #4357: the undo moves the
# alias back without arming the resized copy's redirect, so a router whose
# cached pair names R keeps reading and writing R.
MODULE: UniqueOwnerUndoArmsNothing
TARGET: UniqueOwner
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the undo arms no redirect on the resized copy, so a stale router keeps using it
PERTURBS: UndoArm

--- FIND
    /\ redir' = TRUE
    /\ rz' = "undoing"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no redirect is armed.
    /\ redir' = redir
    /\ rz' = "undoing"
--- END